that's it, see you in fall.


00:02:53.799 --> 00:02:55.961
Mr. Laube, do you have a moment?


00:02:57.427 --> 00:02:59.509
It's about the scholarship.


00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.422
Unfortunately,
the foundation chose someone else.


00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:05.887
Your work was great, one of the best.


00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:09.887
And I know that you can use the money
well, better than most in here.


00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:12.435
But you've been a bit naive,
haven't you?


00:03:12.651 --> 00:03:13.516
Why?


00:03:13.694 --> 00:03:18.279
Well, the Adenauer Foundation
is not a liberal think tank.


00:03:18.657 --> 00:03:22.571
And your attitude towards American
drones was quite radical.


00:03:22.703 --> 00:03:25.161
Radical?
That was all thoroughly researched.


00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:28.789
I know, Mr. Laube.
But in politics you have to consider:


00:03:29.126 --> 00:03:31.117
What is my goal
and how can I achieve it?


00:03:31.294 --> 00:03:34.082
Strategic thinking.
That's what you still have to learn.


00:03:35.006 --> 00:03:38.715
And what about attitude?
You did talk about attitude.


00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:43.424
I'm sorry, Mr. Laube.
Have a nice summer.


00:03:43.765 --> 00:03:44.755
Likewise.


00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:10.539
To make yourself really stable
you can do this.


00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:12.120
That's right.


00:04:12.794 --> 00:04:15.877
Let's do it again.
Starting position.


00:05:32.123 --> 00:05:33.989
Did you get the pills?


00:05:35.126 --> 00:05:37.709
Yes, I did.
- Ok.


00:05:39.714 --> 00:05:42.001
Mom, I don't know if I'll do it.


00:05:42.217 --> 00:05:44.379
Jule, please.
We discussed this.


00:05:44.553 --> 00:05:48.137
Consider your future...
- Yeah, but it's my decision, ok?


00:05:48.223 --> 00:05:51.090
And I can't make this decision alone.
I...


00:05:51.226 --> 00:05:53.058
...have to talk to Alex.


00:05:53.228 --> 00:05:55.560
He's involved too, right?
- So call him.


00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.892
I tried, he's not answering.


00:05:58.066 --> 00:05:59.932
And maybe that's better.


00:06:00.151 --> 00:06:01.437
